#==============================================================================================
#
#   close_watcher_manager - HTML::CloseWatcherManager: a Window's groups of close watchers
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of Libraries/LibWeb/HTML/CloseWatcherManager.cpp (lines 1-121): adding and
#       removing close watchers, processing them (the Escape key), the user activation that
#       allows a new group, and whether a cancel action may prevent the close.
